// An empty `Map()` delivered straight into a union of two map types at every position: it
// takes the first arm it fits, so `is` of the other arm is false (owner ruling 2026-11-15).
// The un-annotated face has no union to deliver into: its `Map()` is open and fits every
// test of its kind (D16047), so that face's cells print 0 by design.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
type __L = {[i32]: boolean} | {[i32]: i32}
// @@VALUE@@
Map()
// @@TYPE@@
__L
// @@TEST@@
v is {[i32]: i32}
// @@HIT@@
print(0)
// @@MISS@@
print(42)
// @@WANT@@
42
// @@WANT_UNANNOTATED@@
0
